**“Commercial Cloud Service”** means providing the Software, or a Derivative Work substantially based upon it, to third parties as a hosted, managed, multi-tenant, or single-tenant database service, database-as-a-service (DBaaS), platform-as-a-service (PaaS), or infrastructure service where the primary purpose is to provide database functionality to external customers for a fee or other commercial benefit.

A service that merely uses ULTSQL internally as part of its own application is **not**, by itself, a Commercial Cloud Service.

